# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-9, 2.1-11). L §5.14: a relabel's "amount is written: "all of p's" is bal(x) of p, a running
# read, so such a posting is a decision with reads x (§5.14.1)"; L §5.10: "inside a decision, the running bal(x) of q
# read[s] the same points as [its total does]". g gives all of tomek's (80.00, inh's) to ania: ania 80.00, tomek 0.00,
# g's leg 80.00 (scratch/exp4.py).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
kind couples: parties
kind savings: place PLN min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w order if w in gifts and k.owner == w.giver then 0 else 1, if k.owner == ania_tomek then 0 else 1
kind gifts: transfers
  attr giver: key persons
  attr receiver: key persons
kind inhs: transfers
place konto: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_day: date
input wage_amt: money PLN
input inh_day: date
input inh_amt: money PLN
input g_day: date
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num at m.day
  rule community = if p == ania_tomek then 1 else 0
  rule gift beats community = if p == m.receiver then 1 else 0 when m in gifts
  rule inh beats community = if p == tomek then 1 else 0 when m in inhs
move wage: transfers
  on wage_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt
move inh: inhs
  on inh_day
  leg cash from world to konto amount inh_amt
move g: gifts
  on g_day
  reads konto
  attr giver = tomek
  attr receiver = ania
  leg cash from konto to konto amount bal(konto) of tomek
ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31) of ania, bal(konto, 2026-03-31) of tomek, g.cash.amount

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  persons + [tomek] lives 1981-01-01..
  couples + [ania_tomek] lives 2010-06-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  wage_day = 2026-02-01
  wage_amt = 100.00 PLN
  inh_day = 2026-02-15
  inh_amt = 80.00 PLN
  g_day = 2026-03-01
=== expect
q: (80.00 PLN, 0.00 PLN, 80.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-01-01
